What is in the box, and under what
----------------------------------

AGPL-3.0-or-later:
  src/**                     this package's JavaScript (the audio graph, PTT and adapter)
  _framework/M0LTE.Dsp.wasm       FFT, FIR, decimator, upsampler, spectrum
  _framework/M0LTE.Fec.wasm       CRC-16/X-25, Hamming(7,4), Reed-Solomon, Viterbi
  _framework/M0LTE.FecLdpc.wasm   LDPC codec
  _framework/M0LTE.Ofdm.wasm      OFDM modem

GPL-3.0-or-later:
  _framework/Packet.SoundModem.wasm   the modem core: modulators, demodulators, framing
  _framework/M0LTE.Il2p.wasm          the IL2P frame codec
  _framework/pdn-modem-wasm.wasm      the JavaScript-facing surface of the core

